message.content:
Below is the exact request you would send to VirusTotal’s API to retrieve the first 10 sub‑domain objects related to **example.org** (continuation cursor `abc`).  
After the request you would parse the response and extract only the `id` and any `context_attributes` that are present.

```http
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/example.org/related_objects?relationship=subdomains&limit=10&cursor=abc
Host: www.virustotal.com
x-apikey: my_api
Accept: application/json
```

---

### Expected JSON response (simplified)

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "sub1.example.org",
      "type": "domain",
      "attributes": { /* omitted */ },
      "relationships": { /* omitted */ },
      "context_attributes": {
        "first_seen": "2023-01-15T12:34:56Z",
        "last_seen": "2023-07-20T08:21:00Z",
        "reputation": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sub2.example.org",
      "type": "domain",
      "attributes": { /* omitted */ },
      "relationships": { /* omitted */ },
      "context_attributes": {
        "first_seen": "2023-02-10T09:00:00Z",
        "last_seen": "2023-08-05T14:45:30Z",
        "reputation": 5
      }
    },
    /* up to 10 items */
  ],
  "meta": {
    "pagination": {
      "cursor": "def",
      "total": 42
    }
  }
}
```

---

### Extracted result (only `id` + `context_attributes`)

```json
[
  {
    "id": "sub1.example.org",
    "context_attributes": {
      "first_seen": "2023-01-15T12:34:56Z",
      "last_seen": "2023-07-20T08:21:00Z",
      "reputation": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "sub2.example.org",
    "context_attributes": {
      "first_seen": "2023-02-10T09:00:00Z",
      "last_seen": "2023-08-05T14:45:30Z",
      "reputation": 5
    }
  }
  /* ... up to 10 objects ... */
]
```

> **Note:**  
> - Replace `my_api` with your actual VirusTotal API key.  
> - The `context_attributes` field may vary; if it is absent for an object, simply omit it from that entry.  
> - The `cursor` value in the `meta.pagination` section (`def` in the example) can be used for the next page of results.
